[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) says one issue, one fix queued. Its own table already disagrees: it
shows two causes and footnotes a third. This page splits the ticket into the problems it holds,
one ticket each, so each one can get its own fix.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. The queued parser fix closes only the <code>parser</code> row. The other two keep
coming after it ships.
</Callout>

## What is in #4471

